Since the previously passes *args and **kwargs are actually useless, we could just use any kwarg passed to tool init to the DDGS initialization, like:
```py
tool = DuckDuckGoSearchTool(
    timeout= 20,
    proxies=socks5h://localhost:9050,
    headers= {'User-Agent': 'my-custom-agent'}
)
```

